Notes on the design:

- `onApplyDefaults()` is the standard `fflib_SObjectDomain` hook that fires only on `before insert`, so the defaults apply only when records are created and never on update, exactly as required.
- Each field is only set when it is currently `null`, so values already supplied are preserved.
- The `Constructor` inner class implements `fflib_SObjectDomain.IConstructable`, allowing `fflib_SObjectDomain.triggerHandler(Opportunities.class)` to build the domain instance for every trigger context.
- The trigger covers all seven DML events and delegates entirely to the domain layer, keeping the trigger itself logic-free.

