 * LimitException, failing the whole update. Instead we enqueue a SINGLE
 * CaseSurveyJob for the batch of newly-closed cases. The job processes each case
 * independently (partial-success insert), so one bad record still cannot affect
 * the others.
 */
trigger CaseTrigger on Case (after update) {
